  "internal_thinking": "I am currently at 4 victory points and need only one more to win the game. My most direct path to victory is building a settlement at node 23, where I have already established a road connection. To do this, I need 1 Wood (עץ), 1 Brick (טיט), 1 Wheat (חיטה), and 1 Sheep (כבשה). My current inventory is 3 Wood and 2 Wheat. This means I am missing 1 Brick and 1 Sheep. While I produce Brick at node 20 (on hex 5, which is a 6), I currently have none. Neither Shon nor Ziv appears to have Brick in their hand right now, but both Shon and Ziv have Sheep. Shon has been very vocal about blocking me, so I will try to negotiate with Ziv, who has one Sheep. I'll offer him Wood in exchange, hoping he'll prioritize his own growth over Shon's warnings. If this trade fails, I'll likely have to wait for the dice to roll a 6 for Brick and a 5, 8, or 4 for Sheep, as trading 3:1 at my port would leave me without the Wood necessary to build the settlement this turn.",
  "note_to_self": "I need Brick and Sheep to win at node 23. I have production for both (Brick on 6 at node 20; Sheep on 5, 8, and 4 at nodes 9, 20, and 25). Ziv is the more likely trade partner for Sheep since Shon is actively trying to block me.",
  "say_outloud": "זיו, עזוב את שון, הוא סתם מנסה לצייר אותי כמטרה כדי שאף אחד לא ישים לב שהוא יושב על הר של חיטה ויכול לקנות חצי מהקופה. אני רחוקה מטיט ורחוקה מכבשה. אולי תרצה לעשות החלפה קטנה? עץ תמורת כבשה? זה יעזור לשנינו להתקדם קצת מול שון.",
